  "plan": "1) Check for a non-apt downloader (wget/python3). 2) Use `apt-get install --print-uris -y curl` to list the .deb URLs for curl and its dependencies (this command prints URIs without the space check). 3) Then download those .debs with wget/python and install them with `dpkg -i`. First, gather the tools and URIs.",
